      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see. Yes, the table on page 62 in Section 7.2 is a little ambiguous. We can disambiguate by using the two arguments I gave earlier. So, the table is meant to show SRGB is supported by profile 1 or 3, but there\u0027s no correlation between the SRGB color space and chroma subsampling indicated by that table.",
