      "side": 1,
      "message": "Marco: I just realized that we only need one of your original two checks here:\n\n```\n  if (cm-\u003ecolor_space \u003d\u003d VPX_CS_SRGB \u0026\u0026\n      (subsampling_x !\u003d 0 || subsampling_y !\u003d 0)) {\n    vpx_internal_error(\u0026cm-\u003eerror, VPX_CODEC_INVALID_PARAM,\n                       \"SRGB color space requires 4:4:4\");\n    res \u003d -1;\n  }\n```\n\nbecause once we know the chroma subsampling format is 4:4:4, then the check at lines 5770-5775 ensures that the profile is 1 or 3.",
      "revId": "b84ca9b63730e7d4563573a56a66317eb0087ebf",
